Redirects are implemented via tiny prerendered HTML stubs rather than client-side navigation. This ensures crawlers see proper HTTP 200 responses with meta refresh and canonical directives, making the redirects crawler-visible. The implementation follows the existing pattern used for untranslated /en/* paths in this codebase.

